{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22470","headline":"开元寺东池早春 · 白居易","name":"开元寺东池早春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池水暖温暾，水清波潋灩。\n簇簇青泥中，新蒲叶如劒。\n梅房小白裹，柳彩轻黄染。\n顺气草熏熏，适情鸥泛泛。\n旧游成梦寐，往事随阳焱。\n芳物感幽怀，一动平生念。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}